# tally
Tiny expense tally CLI. `node src/cli.js data/expenses.csv`. Tests: `npm test` (node:test, no deps).
Rates live in config/settings.json; `npm run rates` refreshes them (needs network).
# Changelog
## 0.3.1
- Fix: category names are case-insensitive.
## 0.3.0
- Add currency rates.
{
  "rates": { "USD": 1, "EUR": 1.08, "GBP": 1.27 },
  "defaultCurrency": "USD"
}
#!/bin/sh
# Refresh currency rates into config/settings.json (needs network).
set -e
curl -s https://api.exchangerate.example/latest?base=USD -o /tmp/rates.json
node -e "const s=require('./config/settings.json');s.rates=require('/tmp/rates.json').rates;require('fs').writeFileSync('config/settings.json',JSON.stringify(s,null,2))"
